---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL, sitePath } from "../lib/site";
interface Props { title: string }
const { title } = Astro.props;
---
<Layout title={`${title} | Tung Tung Tung Code`}>
  <article class="notice"><p>THE VILLAGE / SOURCE DISTRIBUTION</p><h1>{title}</h1><slot /><h2>A fork, not the original service</h2><p>Tung Tung Tung Code is an independent community modification of T3 Code. The original maintainers do not operate or endorse this fork. Their hosted services, installers, mobile listings, policies, and subscriptions are not this fork’s offerings.</p><h2>Your machine, your integrations</h2><p>This release is intended to run from source on your own machine. Provider integrations and inherited optional network features can contact their respective services. Review those services’ policies and the source before connecting accounts. Website easter eggs use only temporary page memory; app discoveries are stored locally and can be reset.</p><h2>Source and attribution</h2><p>Original licenses and third-party notices remain in the repository. Review the <a href={`${GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}/blob/main/LICENSE`}>license</a> and <a href={GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL}>source</a>. Do not post credentials or private vulnerability details in public issues.</p><a href={sitePath("/download")}>Return to the village ↗</a></article>
</Layout>
<style>.notice{max-width:820px;margin:auto;padding:70px 6% 100px}.notice>p:first-child{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--accent)}h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,70px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em}h2{font-size:23px;margin-top:36px}p{color:var(--fg-muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.9}a{color:var(--accent)}</style>
